{
  "FormatVersion": 3,
  "Id": "7953f704-ebee-498b-8bdd-a2c201dfe278"/*SetIntVar*/,
  "Description": "Sets an int variable in the evaluation context that can be read by [GetIntVar] in the connected subgraph.\n\nIf SubGraph is connected, the variable is set while the subgraph is executed and a previous value is restored afterwards. Without a connected subgraph the variable stays set for everything evaluated later.\n\nSee also: [GetIntVar], [Loop]",
